{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#2593","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#2593","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#2593\",\"parent_revision\":\"bba4b2557584e5be02e00fee29672df075d18812420c50064f47377c2f15be82\",\"root_revision\":\"bba4b2557584e5be02e00fee29672df075d18812420c50064f47377c2f15be82\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe `BacklogBackend` Protocol defines four methods whose names are GitHub-specific, even though the protocol is implemented by four backends \u2014 GitHub, SQLite, Memory, and Beads:\\n\\n- `close_github_issue` (sqlite_backend.py:476, memory_backend.py:261, beads_backend.py:318 all implement this)\\n- `resolve_github_issue` (sqlite_backend.py:503, memory_backend.py:277, beads_backend.py:343)\\n- `sync_groomed_to_github_issue` (sqlite_backend.py:786, memory_backend.py:410, beads_backend.py: NotImplementedError per ADR-001)\\n- `view_enrich_from_github` (sqlite_backend.py:611, memory_backend.py:330, beads_backend.py:463)\\n\\nThe method names leak the original GitHub implementation detail into the protocol contract. A future backend author reading the protocol would incorrectly infer these methods are GitHub-specific. No behavioral impact \u2014 all backends implement the methods correctly.\\n\\nVerified at: `backlog_core/backend_protocol.py:421-468, 643` and all four backend files listed above.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **maintainer of the codebase**, I want to **backlogbackend protocol method names leak github implementation detail** so that **the code is cleaner and more maintainable**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: dh-system-model code audit 2026-06-05\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-06-05\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"f750ebd355a32364d3507c1cd37924c06c58373425c5d80610c5f2d995880263\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVCL3uQ\"}"}